Resource requirements for one evaluation host
=============================================

CPU        any x86-64 or arm64, 4 cores is comfortable, 2 works
GPU        none. CPU-only inference throughout
RAM        16 GB minimum. qwen3:14b holds roughly 10 GB resident at a
           4096-token context; 24 GB on the reference host
DISK       12 GB free for the required model + 54 MB checkout.
           25 GB if all seven cross-family models are pulled
NETWORK    needed only to clone, pip install, and pull models.
           Nothing at run time. No API keys, no paid services
OS         Linux or macOS. Python >= 3.11
TIME       5 min for the model-free smoke path
           ~1 h for the eight claim scripts under claims/
           ~9 h for a full reproduction, dominated by a 7.5 h agent sweep

This artifact does NOT fit a minimal 1 CPU / 2 GB RAM / 10 GB disk VM,
because of the local model. The deterministic-stub path (ARTIFACT.md
section 3a, and claims 3-7, which need no model) does fit such a VM.

Suggested Chameleon node: any compute_skylake or compute_cascadelake
instance. Suggested CloudLab node: c220g2 or newer. Both far exceed the
requirement; the binding constraint is RAM, not cores.
